urceDocument: cv_amara_diallo_project_manager.pdf\npublished: unknown\n</document_metadata>\n\nAmara N. Diallo\nSenior Project Manager — Digital Health & Public Sector Systems\nProfile\nPMP-certified project manager with 11 years of experience leading digital transformation projects for\ngovernment and public health clients. Specializes in case management systems, stakeholder coordination\nacross multi-site deployments, and Agile delivery for regulated environments.\nRelevant Experience\nLead Project Manager — National Immunization Registry Modernization (2023–2024)\nl\nManaged a 14-person cross-functional team delivering a case/registry management platform for a national\nhealth ministry across 40+ clinics.\nl\nCoordinated integration with an existing national health data exchange, similar in scope to NHIE-style API\nintegrations.\nl\nDelivered the project on budget and within a 10-month timeline using a phased Agile rollout.\nProject Manager — Regional Social Services Case Tracking System (2021–2022)\nl\nLed requirements workshops with 200+ field staff across 8 regional offices.\nl\nOversaw UAT and staff training rollout for a case management system serving both web and mobile users.\nCertifications\nl\nPMP (Project Management Professional)\nl\nCertified ScrumMaster (CSM)\nEducation\nM.Sc. in Information Systems Management"}}]]